  </item>
  <item>
    <title>渐渐地，我学会接受任何人的离开</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687faa88a9dec92500a44dd9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687faa88a9dec92500a44dd9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Jul 2025 15:27:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主题：</span><strong><span>「我变得可以接受任何人的离开」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>这是我们做过最特别的一期——从开口的第一秒就泪流不止，直到最后一个字。希望这些故事，也能轻轻叩响你记忆的门。</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏳ 时间轴</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么要讲这个话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="68">01:08</a> "关系具有阶段性"：鲁豫那段让我们瞬间破防的话</span></p><span></span><p><span>那些刻骨铭心却渐行渐远的关系：</span></p><span></span><p><span>友情篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 产后朋友说："我现在接不住你的梗了"的心碎瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a> 朋友直接撩开肚子给我看妊娠纹的治愈时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="402">06:42</a> 那个把我每句玩笑都当真的靠谱朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>亲情篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="533">08:53</a> 爷爷走后，那个永远无法兑现的五星级酒店承诺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 再也不敢走进那家带爷爷吃过的打边炉店</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 现在，我多希望世上真有鬼魂</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱情篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1134">18:54</a> 不再删除前任照片：否定过去就是否定自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1322">22:02</a> 最温柔的分手安慰："我在世界的某个角落好好活着"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 每个离开的人，都在你身上留下了痕迹</span></p><span></span><p><span>成长篇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1490">24:50</a> 生活这场大浪淘沙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 弱关系：现代人的情感安全网</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1658">27:38</a> 《昼颜》的启示：适度疏离让关系更健康</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1718">28:38</a> "此刻永远"比"永远"更真实</span></p><span></span><p><span>📚 延伸阅读</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 鲁豫×张春对谈</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 日剧《昼颜》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 《千与千寻》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 项飙《把自己作为方法》</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 苏轼《记承天寺夜游》</span></p><span></span><p><span>💬此刻，我想问：</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1️⃣ 你手机里存着哪张再也不会删的照片？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2️⃣ 有没有一个地方，你再也不敢去？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>3️⃣ 你身上留着谁的影子？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>留言区等你，让故事继续🌊</span></p><span></span><p><span>"有些人注定是生命中的过客，</span></p><span></span><p><span>但他们经过时，</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>都曾认真地为你的夜空添过一颗星！</span></strong><span>"</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6846fa4a270bcdcac3b21ee7/ltop2kFmDig6SkttZohXjyq0JC6W.m4a" length="61050521" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:31:37</itunes:duration>
